sequenceDiagram
    actor M as Manager
    participant T as Microsoft Teams
    participant B as In-Office Hours Assistant
    participant API as Employee Data API

    M->>T: "Who's at risk this month?"
    T->>B: message activity
    B->>B: resolve identity & role
    B->>API: get manager team (direct reports)
    alt no team returned
        B-->>T: "No team found" (team commands unavailable)
    else team returned
        API-->>B: per-report current + historic hours
        B->>B: compute at-risk (projected < 100), sort by shortfall
        B-->>T: at-risk list (largest shortfall first)
        M->>T: "Log annual leave for {report}, {month}"
        T->>B: message activity
        B->>API: get motivation types
        API-->>B: type list
        B-->>T: confirm type + month + description?
        M->>T: confirm
        B->>API: upsert motivation (employee + type + month)
        API-->>B: saved
        B-->>T: success acknowledgement
    end
